everything on this plate

00:07:46.020 --> 00:07:48.700
is what I think it is, what I know to be

00:07:48.700 --> 00:07:50.193
because I put it on there.

00:07:51.780 --> 00:07:54.960
So by using a flame,

00:07:54.960 --> 00:07:58.250
you can protect the
bacteria from other things,

00:07:58.250 --> 00:08:00.773
