and more and more of that,
and then the cell breaks open,

00:36:09.250 --> 00:36:11.230
and now each of those particles goes

00:36:11.230 --> 00:36:14.350
into another one of the human cells,

00:36:14.350 --> 00:36:17.280
and says, "Stop what you're
doing, make more of me."

00:36:17.280 --> 00:36:21.763
And that's the cycle and how
it can get to different cells.

00:36:24.160 --> 00:36:24.993
Let me see.

